{"schemaVersion":1,"slug":"cockovy-salat-s-dijonskou-zalivkou","title":"Čočkový salát s dijonskou zálivkou","description":"Svěží salát z hnědé čočky, zeleniny, rukoly a volitelné fety.","demo":false,"yield":{"amount":6,"label":"porce"},"prepMinutes":15,"cookMinutes":15,"category":"Saláty","tags":["Vegetariánské","Čočka","Bez lepku"],"ingredients":[{"items":[{"id":"cocka","name":"suchá hnědá čočka","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":1.5},"unit":"cup"},{"id":"vyvar","name":"zeleninový vývar","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":4},"unit":"cup"},{"id":"sul","name":"sůl","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":1},"unit":"tsp"},{"id":"cherry-rajcata","name":"cherry rajčata","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":140},"unit":"g","approximate":true},{"id":"okurka","name":"salátová okurka","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":0.5},"unit":"ks"},{"id":"cervena-cibule","name":"červená cibule","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":0.25},"unit":"ks"},{"id":"susena-rajcata","name":"sušená rajčata v oleji","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":0.25},"unit":"cup"},{"id":"rukola","name":"baby rukola","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":2},"unit":"cup"},{"id":"ocet","name":"bílý vinný ocet","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":2},"unit":"tbsp"},{"id":"olivovy-olej","name":"olivový olej","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":2},"unit":"tbsp"},{"id":"neutralni-olej","name":"neutrální olej","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":2},"unit":"tbsp"},{"id":"cukr","name":"cukr","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":0.5},"unit":"tbsp"},{"id":"horcice","name":"dijonská hořčice","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":0.5},"unit":"tbsp"},{"id":"oregano","name":"sušené oregano","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":1},"unit":"tsp"},{"id":"cesnekovy-prasek","name":"česnekový prášek","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":0.5},"unit":"tsp"},{"id":"feta","name":"feta","quantity":{"kind":"number","value":0.25},"unit":"cup","note":"volitelné"}]}],"steps":["Čočku vařte s vývarem a polovinou soli 15–20 minut doměkka. Sceďte a nechte 5 minut zchladnout.","Připravte zeleninu. Ocet, oba oleje, cukr, hořčici, oregano, česnekový prášek a zbytek soli vyšlehejte na zálivku.","Vychladlou čočku promíchejte se zálivkou, zeleninou, rukolou a sušenými rajčaty. Nakonec případně posypte fetou."],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.acouplecooks.com/lentil-salad/","author":"Sonja Overhiser · A Couple Cooks","importedAt":"2026-09-19"}],"provenance":{"kind":"facts"}}
